# Redistributable fallback sound names shipped with ZAICODE.
# Every file is synthesized by scripts/audio/generate_fallback_sounds.py from
# original code (sine partials, shaped noise, envelopes), including the six
# Problip cues. SHA256 identities are in fallback-sounds.sha256.json. No
# recording, game asset or third-party waveform is read.  Anything else the
# app can play comes from the operator's customization\sounds folder.
